      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 09 — Research Pipeline\nSPECIALIST AGENT execution, one execution per task.\n\n**Agents:** Client Intake, Requirements Analyst, Project Manager, Research Coordinator (+ Source Summarizer, Fact Checker), Content Research, Competitive Research, Asset Research.\n\nStart → pre-execution tools (real audits) → Model Router → Context Builder (only what this task needs) → Key Manager / 55 RPM limiter → NVIDIA call → structured-output review (schema, files, sub-agents, review gates) → next stage. Failures go to the Error / Retry Manager.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
